data: {"messages":[{"content":"请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"82709043-ae6f-4205-af5d-6d1acb229b19"}],"viewed_images":{},"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/f5ce54f4-55a1-4243-908c-0159cb75bbd4/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/f5ce54f4-55a1-4243-908c-0159cb75bbd4/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/f5ce54f4-55a1-4243-908c-0159cb75bbd4/user-data/outputs"},"raw_messages":[],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","normalized_query":"请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","routing_query":"场景：网络流量。场景ID：network_traffic。场景说明：网络流量、PCAP、会话、协议、异常通信、恶意流量、网络安全事件分析场景。需要识别参数：分析对象、分析目标、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，将网络流量场景下的事件分为自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类","scene":"network_traffic","scene_name":"网络流量","params":{"分析对象":"事件","分析目标":"根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响进行分类","输出形式":"自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["network_traffic"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_8df8dc","text":"请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_9b2754","text":"针对网络流量场景下的原始事件日志与PCAP会话记录，调用数据解析能力提取关键字段，重点定位告警置信度数值、证据链完整度标识及潜在影响等级描述，完成非结构化数据的结构化清洗与字段对齐，产出标准化事件特征表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_2bbfc4","text":"依托网络安全运营知识库与事件处置规范，检索并加载分类判定基准，建立多维度映射模型：将高置信度配合完整证据映射为“自动通过”，将证据断裂或置信度存疑映射为“需要人工复核”，将涉及核心资产或大规模异常通信的潜在影响映射为“优先复核”，形成可执行的规则引擎配置，产出分类逻辑说明书。"},{"task_span_id":"span_55914c","text":"基于规则引擎对标准化事件特征表执行批量研判，计算各事件在三项维度的综合得分，应用阈值过滤机制完成类别划分，生成附带分类标签与命中规则ID的中间结果集，支持后续自动化流转或人工派单。"},{"task_span_id":"span_18a3ee","text":"针对处于分类边界或存在多标签冲突的事件启用交叉验证模块，核对证据时效性与影响面评估的一致性，剔除误判样本并修正分类权重，输出分类分布统计表与高风险待办清单。"},{"task_span_id":"span_902708","text":"汇总分类结果、判定依据溯源链接及分级处置建议，按安全运营交付标准格式化输出事件分级总表，提供一键导出接口与可视化看板数据源，完成从数据输入到决策就绪的全链路规划。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_c0ae1f","scene":"network_traffic","scene_name":"网络流量","text":"我将根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，将网络流量场景下的事件分为自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","params":{"分析对象":"事件","分析目标":"根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响进行分类","输出形式":"自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_c0ae1f","scene":"network_traffic","scene_name":"网络流量","text":"我将根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，将网络流量场景下的事件分为自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","params":{"分析对象":"事件","分析目标":"根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响进行分类","输出形式":"自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：分析对象。需要分析的网络流量文件、数据集或场景名称，如 pcap、pcapng、Neris、DNS、HTTP、TLS、会话日志等","提取可选参数：分析目标。用户希望识别、统计或总结的目标，如异常通信、恶意流量、协议分布、主机行为、IOC、攻击链等","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的结果形式，如 summary、报告、表格、图表、证据清单等"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:82709043-ae6f-4205-af5d-6d1acb229b19"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}}}

event: values
data: {"messages":[{"content":"请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"82709043-ae6f-4205-af5d-6d1acb229b19"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): network_traffic. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: 请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"547a427d-a926-47a7-b1cc-8ed36f9663f5"}],"viewed_images":{},"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/f5ce54f4-55a1-4243-908c-0159cb75bbd4/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/f5ce54f4-55a1-4243-908c-0159cb75bbd4/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/f5ce54f4-55a1-4243-908c-0159cb75bbd4/user-data/outputs"},"raw_messages":[],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","normalized_query":"请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","routing_query":"场景：网络流量。场景ID：network_traffic。场景说明：网络流量、PCAP、会话、协议、异常通信、恶意流量、网络安全事件分析场景。需要识别参数：分析对象、分析目标、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，将网络流量场景下的事件分为自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类","scene":"network_traffic","scene_name":"网络流量","params":{"分析对象":"事件","分析目标":"根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响进行分类","输出形式":"自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["network_traffic"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_8df8dc","text":"请根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，把事件分成自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_9b2754","text":"针对网络流量场景下的原始事件日志与PCAP会话记录，调用数据解析能力提取关键字段，重点定位告警置信度数值、证据链完整度标识及潜在影响等级描述，完成非结构化数据的结构化清洗与字段对齐，产出标准化事件特征表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_2bbfc4","text":"依托网络安全运营知识库与事件处置规范，检索并加载分类判定基准，建立多维度映射模型：将高置信度配合完整证据映射为“自动通过”，将证据断裂或置信度存疑映射为“需要人工复核”，将涉及核心资产或大规模异常通信的潜在影响映射为“优先复核”，形成可执行的规则引擎配置，产出分类逻辑说明书。"},{"task_span_id":"span_55914c","text":"基于规则引擎对标准化事件特征表执行批量研判，计算各事件在三项维度的综合得分，应用阈值过滤机制完成类别划分，生成附带分类标签与命中规则ID的中间结果集，支持后续自动化流转或人工派单。"},{"task_span_id":"span_18a3ee","text":"针对处于分类边界或存在多标签冲突的事件启用交叉验证模块，核对证据时效性与影响面评估的一致性，剔除误判样本并修正分类权重，输出分类分布统计表与高风险待办清单。"},{"task_span_id":"span_902708","text":"汇总分类结果、判定依据溯源链接及分级处置建议，按安全运营交付标准格式化输出事件分级总表，提供一键导出接口与可视化看板数据源，完成从数据输入到决策就绪的全链路规划。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_c0ae1f","scene":"network_traffic","scene_name":"网络流量","text":"我将根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，将网络流量场景下的事件分为自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","params":{"分析对象":"事件","分析目标":"根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响进行分类","输出形式":"自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_c0ae1f","scene":"network_traffic","scene_name":"网络流量","text":"我将根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响，将网络流量场景下的事件分为自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核三类。","params":{"分析对象":"事件","分析目标":"根据告警置信度、证据完整性和潜在影响进行分类","输出形式":"自动通过、需要人工复核和优先复核"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：分析对象。需要分析的网络流量文件、数据集或场景名称，如 pcap、pcapng、Neris、DNS、HTTP、TLS、会话日